first_missing_positive.optimal:
n = size of nums
for each index i from 0 to n - 1:
    while 1 <= nums[i] <= n and nums[nums[i] - 1] != nums[i]:
        home = nums[i] - 1
        swap nums[i] and nums[home]   (value v is parked at index v - 1)
for each index i from 0 to n - 1:
    if nums[i] != i + 1:   (slot i should hold i + 1)
        return i + 1
return n + 1

